# Sample MCP Tools/List Request
File: mcp/examples/tools_list_request.oot

## Request

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/list",
  "params": {}
}
```

## Expected

20 tools. Names include get_orientation, get_rules, get_rfc, get_practice.

Names do not include ooda.northstar or get_milestone_status.
